==Special attack==
[[File:Tumeken's Light.gif|thumb|250px|A player performing the Keris partisan of the sun's special attack, ''Tumeken's Light''.]]
The keris partisan of the sun has a [[special attacks|special attack]], ''Tumeken's Light'', which consumes 50 [[prayer points]] in addition to 75% of the player's special attack energy. If the user has less than 50 current prayer points, they cannot use this special attack.

The special attack will fully heal the player to their maximum health and overheal players up to 20% of their base Hitpoints level. It will also cure [[poison]], and venom, as well as restore the player's [[run energy]] and any drained [[stats]].

Attempting to use the special attack outside of the Tombs of Amascut gives the message {{mes|This special attack can only be used within the Tombs of Amascut.}}

